title: "SpectralFlow"
abstract: >-
  A 2D lattice Boltzmann wind tunnel and wing contour test bench with
  vorticity, Schlieren, pressure coefficient, live streamline seeding,
  thickness, and speed fields, and chordwise surface pressure traces.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/draarivpatel-ui/spectralflow"
url: "https://draarivpatel-ui.github.io/spectralflow/"
